id: pm-0mox
title: "Alias-usage counters: measure deprecated-spelling hits so grammar-freeze removals are evidence-based"
description: Record privacy-safe deprecated-alias usage counters so removal decisions after the grammar freeze are evidence-based rather than time-based.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 3
tags[3]: agent-ux,cli-simplification,telemetry
